                "actions": {
                    "value": 3
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Life shunts an adjacent willing or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Unconscious] target into a personal pocket dimension capable of holding one creature of size Large or smaller for an indefinite period of time. While inside the dimensional refuge, the creature is invulnerable to all damage, can't be targeted, and no rounds elapse for any conditions, afflictions, or other ongoing effects it has, but it can't perceive the outside world or take actions except to exit the refuge as a free action, emerging into a space adjacent to Life. Life can expel the refuge's current occupant as a free action.</p>"
                },
